cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OUI change history
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it and link back to
  https://ssid.ai/directory
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: ssid.ai
    website: https://ssid.ai
    city: Dubai
    country: AE
repository-code: https://github.com/Drumworks/oui-change-history
url: https://ssid.ai/directory
date-released: 2026-09-01
version: 2026-09-01
abstract: >-
  A change history for the IEEE OUI registry, which the IEEE itself publishes as
  current state only. Reconstructed from 76 dated captures of
  https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui/oui.csv between 2016-07-29 and
  2026-09-01, 2044 rename events across 1843
  prefixes are recorded, plus 5 withdrawals and
  0 reassignments, plus 281 formatting-only restyles that are typed
  separately and excluded from the headline. 1848 of the
  40044 prefixes in the registry, 4.6 percent, have changed the
  organisation they resolve to. Every row carries the archive URL it was observed in.
keywords:
  - MAC address
  - OUI
  - IEEE registry
  - device identification
  - network inventory
  - provenance
  - open data
